      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photo Cleaner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "看看有多少截图可以清理，以及那年今日拍的照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See how many screenshots you can clean and what you shot on this day."
